travis barker just took a plane to cabo  with his girlfriend kourtney kardashian  marking his first time flying since he  survived a 2008 plane crash  according to tmz the lovebirds were  joined by court's mom kris jenner and  her longtime boyfriend corey gamble on  kylie jenner's private jet  that's travis dressed casually in a  white tank gray pants and black beanie  and court in a black dress with  sunglasses stepping off of the jet it  was beautiful amazing once the two  touched down court shared several snaps  from their lavish accommodations on her  insta story including a pool by the  ocean and coffee by the pool  the blink 182 drummer and his friend  adam dj am goldstein were the only two  survivors when their plane crashed on  their way home from a show in south  carolina in 2008. the crash killed  assistant chris baker security guard  charles still and the two pilots and  while they were able to escape the crash  travis was left with third-degree burns  that covered 65 percent of his body  forcing him to undergo 26 surgeries and  multiple skin grafts and about a year  after the crash adam died of an  accidental drug overdose as for travis  he's been open about the trauma he's  experienced since the plane crash in may  the musician spoke to men's health  magazine about dealing with survivor's  guilt and expressed his hope to one day  fly again quote if i saw a plane in the  sky i was determined it was going to  crash and i just didn't want to see it  now it's been so many years it's getting  easier for me there are days where i'll  wake up and never think about it barker  added that he considered the crash a  wake-up call and dedicated himself to  living a healthier lifestyle and stop  abusing drugs instead of planes travis  opted to travel by car bus and even  ships for the past 13 years he told  men's health quote if i do it and the  angels above help me in my travels and  keep me safe i would like to come back  and tell my children hey i just flew  here and then i flew home and everything  was fine  [Music]  you
 

